ZLLimiter for WebCLAP (ports/zl-limiter), all under ZL_WEBCLAP:

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- PluginProcessor.hpp, controller.hpp: ZLWebclapAccess (ports/zl-limiter/zl_limiter_access.h) as a friend of
  both, for the analyzer status, value transport and controls that cross over as frames
- curve_panel.cpp: no threads, so the analyzer worker loop runs one pass per repaint (paintOverChildren) on the
  editor's thread instead of waiting for notify()
- compact_combobox: the kit's JUCE names the display areas userArea/totalArea and has no popup item tooltips
  (ZL's JUCE fork adds them)
- top_panel, main_panel, ui_setting_panel, ui_setting_components: no preset browser (button and panel), no
  Colour and no Credit tab (the settings open on Control), a one-line legal notice below the settings footer;
  the CMakeLists drops panel/preset_browser/, colour_setting_panel.cpp and credit_panel.cpp from the build
- other_ui_setting_panel, ui_state.cpp, main_panel.cpp: no tooltip language setting, tooltips in English
  whatever the state says
- PluginEditor.cpp: not resizable, no resize corner (the page shows the editor at its size)

